# What NOT to upload when deploying.
#
# This file exists mainly to override .gitignore, which Vercel falls back to
# when it is absent. The Android package under public/download is deliberately
# git-ignored - it is an 8 MB binary rebuilt on every release, and committing
# it would change the very commit that defines its own build identity, so a
# phone would compare itself against a deployment it could never match. It
# still has to reach the deployment, which is what this file allows.
node_modules
android
release
dist
.git
.env.local
.vercel
